  "description": "In the game world of Pangaenia, Hyeon-Myeong is known as “the Phantom,” an anonymous legend admired by players. In real life, however, he is jobless and still getting over his recent breakup. When his character is killed and permanently deleted, his only remaining goal to become the first gamer to beat Pangaenia is shattered. Soon, however, Pangaenia begins to merge with the real world, and Hyeon-Myeong gets a chance to start over--this time, with 13 hidden traits. \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
